+# Cozy food and fur artwork — 2026-10-08
+
+Generated with the built-in ImageGen tool. Both assets use genuine alpha transparency and are bundled in web/iOS/Android exports.
+
+- `assets/images/food/ramen-bowl.png`: generated from text, no input image. Displayed as menu art, in the serving close-up, and beside the resident while eating. Steam and serving motion are implemented in code.
+- `assets/images/characters/mofumofu-fur.png`: edit mode, referenced original `assets/images/characters/odango.png`. Face-free texture for the existing volume model; eyes, cheeks, mouth, pose and silhouette remain code-driven. The original mascot asset is unchanged.
+
+## Ramen prompt
+
+Use case: stylized-concept. Asset type: premium high-resolution food sprite for the cozy pastel fantasy game YOKI YOKI, to be shown very large during a serving animation and also in its menu. Create a spectacularly delicious Japanese ramen bowl, isolated on a truly transparent background, 1024x1024 square. Three-quarter overhead view, entire bowl in frame with 10% clear padding, appetizing generous generous proportions. A refined handmade ivory ceramic bowl with a subtle lavender rim and small plum-blossom motif. Rich amber shoyu broth with glistening fragrant oil droplets, visible golden wavy noodles, two tender glossy rolled chashu slices with lightly seared edges, a halved perfectly jammy orange-yolk egg, vibrant sliced spring onion, bamboo shoots, one pink spiral narutomaki and two crisp dark green nori sheets. Beautiful separate readable ingredients, soft warm restaurant lighting, mouthwatering translucent broth and tactile noodles, dimensional polished animated-film food illustration, compatible with cute rounded toy/storybook scenery. Not photoreal photography, not a simple icon, not plastic toy food, no characters, no faces, no text, no chopsticks floating above, no hands, no table, no tray. Keep steam out of the image so it can be animated in the app. Preserve genuine alpha transparency.
+
+## Fur prompt
+
+Use case: identity-preserve / precise-object-edit. Asset type: face-free furry body texture for this same YOKI YOKI character's animated 3D renderer. The attached image is the edit target and silhouette/proportion reference. Preserve the same broad rounded white mochi-like body, nearly spherical but subtly squat, flat soft bottom, no stretching vertically. Remove only the two eyes, cheek blush and mouth, filling those small regions with natural matching white fur. Improve the coat's visible softness and fullness: luxurious delicate longer white Pomeranian-like double-coat fur, gently layered wispy strands, soft feathered outer silhouette, radial brushing, diffuse warm highlights and subtle ivory-gray depth between soft hair tufts. It must read fluffy and huggable at mobile size rather than like cotton powder or smooth plastic. Keep the same character body silhouette and composition, not a dog: absolutely no ears, paws, nose, tail, eyes, face, accessories or other anatomy. Entire isolated body fully visible with modest transparent padding, clean genuine alpha around individual wispy hairs. 1024 square. This texture will receive the existing projected eyes and mouth in code; do not draw facial features.
